2026-07-27T10:56:04.6167844Z i /tmp/Rtmp9gUAnL/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:56:04.6168192Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:56:04.6168640Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:56:04.6169018Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:56:04.6169870Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:56:04.6170738Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:56:04.6171702Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
